flowchart LR
  subgraph Detect["目标识别"]
    direction TB
    Idle["IDLE<br/>待机"] -->|有工件| Scan["SCAN<br/>扫描工作台"]
    Scan --> Found{"发现可抓工件？"}
  end

  subgraph Picking["接近与抓取"]
    direction TB
    Move["MOVE<br/>逆解并移动到抓取位"] --> Grab["GRAB<br/>闭合夹爪 / 附着工件"]
  end

  subgraph Placing["放置与收尾"]
    direction TB
    Place["PLACE<br/>规划放置位"] --> Reach{"放置位 IK 可达？"}
    Reach -->|可达| Release["打开夹爪并放置"]
    Reach -->|不可达| Fallback["尝试安全放置位"]
    Fallback --> Safe{"安全位可达？"}
    Safe -->|是| Release
    Safe -->|否| Held["停止并保留夹持工件"]
  end

  Found -->|是| Move
  Found -->|否| Done["处理完成<br/>回到 IDLE"]
  Move -->|IK 失败| Skip["标记失败并跳过工件"]
  Skip --> Scan
  Grab --> Place
  Release --> More{"还有待处理工件？"}
  More -->|是| Scan
  More -->|否| Done
  Held --> Recover["手动安全放置"]
  Recover --> Done
